    "difficulty": "easy",
    "code": "public int maxSumSubarray(int[] arr, int k) {\n    int sum = 0;\n    for (int i = 0; i < k; i++) sum += arr[i];\n    int max = sum;\n    for (int i = k; i < arr.length; i++) {\n        sum += arr[i] - arr[i - k];\n        max = Math.max(max, sum);\n    }\n    return max;\n}",
    "timeComplexity": "O(n)",
